(4,'KEEP',[I],'numerical','Inferring Earth-relative free-fall position from three radar-tracked projectiles','Launches, intervals, radial escape speed, no atmosphere and nonrotating Earth are explicit. Newton gravity/relative acceleration and inverse trajectory timing reconstruct the observer position; radar measurement alone does not require relativistic kinematics.'),
