(7,'REJECT',[],'theory','Conditions for positive and negative surface/internal water solitons','No nonlinear dispersive shallow/internal-wave evolution or two-layer constitutive model is supplied. Those specialized continuum-flow relations centrally determine which polarity supports solitary waves and the depth/salinity conditions.'),
