(29,'REJECT',[],'theory','Proper acceleration and tidal forces in a partially specified wormhole metric','The explicit radial metric/functions are acknowledged. Proper acceleration, freely falling observer construction and Riemann tidal-force prescription are not provided; those central GR tools are needed for all parameter bounds. A metric alone is not a supplied operational force model.'),
